{"id":"sancti-09-15.rang","type":"rubric","t":{"fr":["IIᵉ classe — ornements blancs."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Introitus"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Introitus"}],"t":{"la":["Introitus"],"fr":["Introït"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit.1","type":"rubric","t":{"la":["Joann 19:25"],"fr":["Joann 19:25"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit.2","type":"para","dropCap":true,"t":{"la":["Stabant juxta Crucem Jesu Mater ejus, et soror Matris ejus, María Cléophæ, et Salóme et María Magdaléne."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit.3","type":"rubric","t":{"la":["Joann 19:26-27."],"fr":["Joann 19:26-27."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit.4","type":"para","t":{"la":["Múlier, ecce fílius tuus: dixit Jesus; ad discípulum autem: Ecce Mater tua."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit.5","type":"versicle","role":"V","t":{"la":[{"sym":"V"}," ","Glória Patri, et Fílio, et Spirítui Sancto."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit.6","type":"versicle","role":"R","t":{"la":[{"sym":"R"}," ","Sicut erat in princípio, et nunc, et semper, et in sǽcula sæculórum. Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.introit.7","type":"para","t":{"la":["Stabant juxta Crucem Jesu Mater ejus, et soror Matris ejus, María Cléophæ, et Salóme et María Magdaléne."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.gloria","type":"rubric","gloria":true,"t":{"la":["Gloria in excelsis."],"fr":["On dit le Gloria in excelsis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.collecte","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Oratio"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Oratio"}],"t":{"la":["Oratio"],"fr":["Collecte"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.collecte.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Deus, in cujus passióne, secúndum Simeónis prophetíam, dulcíssimam ánimam gloriósæ Vírginis et Matris Maríæ dolóris gladius pertransívit: concéde propítius; ut, qui transfixiónem ejus et passiónem venerándo recólimus, gloriósis méritis et précibus ómnium Sanctórum Cruci fidéliter astántium intercedéntibus, passiónis tuæ efféctum felícem consequámur: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre, in unitáte Spíritus Sancti, Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.collecte.c1","type":"rubric","x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15cc.txt","section":"Oratio"}],"t":{"fr":["Commémoraison : Saint Nicomède, martyr"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.collecte.c1.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Adésto, Dómine, pópulo tuo: ut, beáti Nicomédis Mártyris tui mérita præclára suscípiens, ad impetrándam misericórdiam tuam semper ejus patrocíniis adjuvétur. Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum, Fílium tuum: qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.lecon","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Lectio"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Lectio"}],"t":{"la":["Lectio"],"fr":["Leçon"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.lecon.1","type":"para","style":"intro","t":{"la":["Léctio libri Judith."],"fr":["Lecture du livre de Judith"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.lecon.2","type":"rubric","t":{"la":["Judith 13:22, 23-25"],"fr":["Judith 13:22, 23-25"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.lecon.3","type":"para","t":{"la":["Benedíxit te Dóminus in virtúte sua, quia per te ad níhilum redégit inimícos nostros. Benedícta es tu, fília, a Dómino, Deo excélso, præ ómnibus muliéribus super terram. Benedíctus Dóminus, qui creávit cœlum et terram: quia hódie nomen tuum ita magnificávit, ut non recédat laus tua de ore hóminum, qui mémores fúerint virtútis Dómini in ætérnum, pro quibus non pepercísti ánimæ tuæ propter angústias et tribulatiónem géneris tui, sed subvenísti ruínæ ante conspéctum Dei nostri."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.graduel","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Graduale"}],"t":{"la":["Graduale"],"fr":["Graduel"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.graduel.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Dolorósa et lacrimábilis es, Virgo María, stans juxta Crucem Dómini Jesu, Fílii tui, Redemptóris."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.graduel.2","type":"versicle","role":"V","t":{"la":[{"sym":"V"}," ","Virgo Dei Génetrix, quem totus non capift orbis, hoc crucis fert supplícium, auctor vitæ factus homo. Allelúja, allelúja."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.graduel.3","type":"versicle","role":"V","t":{"la":[{"sym":"V"}," ","Stabat sancta María, cœli Regína et mundi Dómina, juxta Crucem Dómini nostri Jesu Christi dolorósa."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Sequentia"}],"t":{"la":["Sequentia"],"fr":["Séquence"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.1","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Stabat Mater dolorósa",{"br":1},"Juxta Crucem lacrimósa,",{"br":1},"Dum pendébat Fílius."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.2","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Cujus ánimam geméntem,",{"br":1},"Contristátam et doléntem",{"br":1},"Pertransívit gládius."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.3","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["O quam tristis et afflícta",{"br":1},"Fuit illa benedícta",{"br":1},"Mater Unigéniti!"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.4","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Quæ mærébat et dolébat,",{"br":1},"Pia Mater, dum vidébat",{"br":1},"Nati pœnas íncliti."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.5","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Quis est homo, qui non fleret,",{"br":1},"Matrem Christi si vidéret",{"br":1},"In tanto supplício?"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.6","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Quis non posset contristári,",{"br":1},"Christi Matrem contemplári",{"br":1},"Doléntem cum Fílio?"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.7","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Pro peccátis suæ gentis",{"br":1},"Vidit Jesum in torméntis",{"br":1},"Et flagéllis súbditum."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.8","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Vidit suum dulcem",{"br":1},"Natum Moriéndo desolátum,",{"br":1},"Dum emísit spíritum."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.9","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Eja, Mater, fons amóris,",{"br":1},"Me sentíre vim dolóris",{"br":1},"Fac, ut tecum lúgeam."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.10","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Fac, ut árdeat cor meum",{"br":1},"In amándo Christum Deum,",{"br":1},"Ut sibi compláceam."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.11","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Sancta Mater, istud agas,",{"br":1},"Crucifixi fige plagas",{"br":1},"Cordi meo válide."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.12","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Tui Nati vulneráti,",{"br":1},"Tam dignáti pro me pati,",{"br":1},"Pœnas mecum dívide."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.13","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Fac me tecum pie flere,",{"br":1},"Crucifíxo condolére,",{"br":1},"Donec ego víxero."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.14","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Juxta Crucem tecum stare",{"br":1},"Et me tibi sociáre",{"br":1},"In planctu desídero."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.15","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Virgo vírginum præclára.",{"br":1},"Mihi jam non sis amára:",{"br":1},"Fac me tecum plángere."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.16","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Fac, ut portem Christi mortem,",{"br":1},"Passiónis fac consórtem",{"br":1},"Et plagas recólere."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.17","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Fac me plagis vulnerári,",{"br":1},"Fac me Cruce inebriári",{"br":1},"Et cruóre Fílii."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.18","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Flammis ne urar succénsus,",{"br":1},"Per te, Virgo, sim defénsus",{"br":1},"In die judícii."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.19","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Christe, cum sit hinc exíre.",{"br":1},"Da per Matrem me veníre",{"br":1},"Ad palmam victóriæ."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.sequence.20","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Quando corpus moriétur,",{"br":1},"Fac, ut ánimæ donétur",{"br":1},"Paradísi glória.",{"br":1},"Amen. Allelúja."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.evangile","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Evangelium"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Evangelium"}],"t":{"la":["Evangelium"],"fr":["Évangile"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.evangile.1","type":"para","style":"intro","t":{"la":["Sequéntia ",{"sym":"cross"}," sancti Evangélii secúndum Joánnem."],"fr":["Suite ",{"sym":"cross"}," du saint Évangile selon saint Jean"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.evangile.2","type":"rubric","t":{"la":["Joann 19:25-27"],"fr":["Joann 19:25-27"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.evangile.3","type":"para","t":{"la":["In illo témpore: Stabant juxta Crucem Jesu Mater ejus, et soror Matris ejus, María Cléophæ, et María Magdaléne. Cum vidísset ergo Jesus Matrem, et discípulum stantem, quem diligébat, dicit Matri suæ: Múlier, ecce fílius tuus. Deinde dicit discípulo: Ecce Mater tua. Et ex illa hora accépit eam discípulus in sua."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.credo","type":"rubric","credo":true,"t":{"la":["Credo."],"fr":["On dit le Credo."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.offertoire","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Offertorium"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Offertorium"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/07-16.txt","section":"Offertorium"}],"t":{"la":["Offertorium"],"fr":["Offertoire"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.offertoire.1","type":"rubric","t":{"la":["Jer 18:20"],"fr":["Jer 18:20"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.offertoire.2","type":"para","t":{"la":["Recordáre, Virgo Mater, in conspéctu Dei, ut loquáris pro nobis bona, et ut avértat indignatiónem suam a nobis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.secrete","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Secreta"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Secreta"}],"t":{"la":["Secreta"],"fr":["Secrète"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.secrete.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Offérimus tibi preces et hóstias, Dómine Jesu Christe, humíliter supplicántes: ut, qui Transfixiónem dulcíssimi spíritus beátæ Maríæ, Matris tuæ, précibus recensémus; suo suorúmque sub Cruce Sanctórum consórtium multiplicáto piíssimo intervéntu, méritis mortis tuæ, méritum cum beátis habeámus: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre, in unitáte Spíritus Sancti, Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.secrete.c1","type":"rubric","x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15cc.txt","section":"Secreta"}],"t":{"fr":["Commémoraison : Saint Nicomède, martyr"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.secrete.c1.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Súscipe, Dómine, múnera propítius obláta: quæ majestáti tuæ beáti Nicomédis Mártyris comméndet orátio. Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum, Fílium tuum: qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.preface","type":"heading","level":2,"t":{"la":["Præfatio"],"fr":["Préface"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.preface.1","type":"rubric","preface":"maria","t":{"la":["Præfatio de Beata Maria Virgine."],"fr":["Préface de la Sainte Vierge (« Et te in Transfixióne »)."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.communion","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Communio"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Communio"}],"t":{"la":["Communio"],"fr":["Communion"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.communion.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Felices sensus beátæ Maríæ Vírginis, qui sine morte meruérunt martýrii palmam sub Cruce Dómini."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.postcommunion","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15.txt","section":"Postcommunio"},{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Quad5-5.txt","section":"Postcommunio"}],"t":{"la":["Postcommunio"],"fr":["Postcommunion"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.postcommunion.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Sacrifícia, quæ súmpsimus, Dómine Jesu Christe, Transfixiónem Matris tuæ et Vírginis devóte celebrántes: nobis ímpetrent apud cleméntiam tuam omnis boni salutáris efféctum: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre, in unitáte Spíritus Sancti, Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.postcommunion.c1","type":"rubric","x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/09-15cc.txt","section":"Postcommunio"}],"t":{"fr":["Commémoraison : Saint Nicomède, martyr"]}}
{"id":"sancti-09-15.postcommunion.c1.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Puríficent nos, Dómine, sacraménta quæ súmpsimus: et, intercedénte beáto Nicoméde Mártyre tuo, a cunctis effíciant vitiis absolútos. Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum, Fílium tuum: qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
